title: albeni_start
tags:
---
Prince: Hey Albeni.
-> Prince: How are you?
-> Prince: Follow me.
    Albeni: Sure.
    <<Follow "Albeni" "Prince">>
    <<stop>>
-> Prince: Stay here.
    Albeni: Alright, I’ll be here.
    <<StopFollow "Albeni">>
    <<stop>>
-> Prince: {GetDialogueTopicOptionText("Albeni", 0)}
    <<if GetDialogueTopicOptionText("Albeni", 0) == "...">>
        <<stop>>
    <<endif>>
    <<jump {GetDialogueTopicNodeName("Albeni", 0)}>>
-> Prince: {GetDialogueTopicOptionText("Albeni", 1)}
    <<if GetDialogueTopicOptionText("Albeni", 1) == "...">>
        <<stop>>
    <<endif>>
    <<jump {GetDialogueTopicNodeName("Albeni", 1)}>>
-> Prince: {GetDialogueTopicOptionText("Albeni", 2)}
    <<if GetDialogueTopicOptionText("Albeni", 2) == "...">>
        <<stop>>
    <<endif>>
    <<jump {GetDialogueTopicNodeName("Albeni", 2)}>>

===
